22. Maximum Consecutive Ones
Easy
Pattern: Arrays · Counting · Tracking a streak
Given a binary array containing only 0 and 1, find the maximum number of consecutive 1s.
Example: nums = [1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 1]
Output: 3


Solution:

const nums = [1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 1];
let maxCount = 0;
let count = 0;

for (let i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
  if (nums[i] === 1) {
    count = count + 1;
  }

  if (count > maxCount) {
    maxCount = count;
  }

  if (nums[i] != 1) {
    count = 0;
  }
}

console.log(maxCount);
